<!-- ==== Parkiraj in se pelji (P+R) Maribor: kombinirana vozovnica P+R ======
     (Park & Ride Maribor: combined monthly ticket, parking + city bus)
The P+R package of Marprom (Maribor city public transport) in NeTEx (validated against the v2.1-wip-efip XSD),
following the profile of Slovenia_IJPP_GeneralTickets.xml: a monthly parking space at a P+R car park combined
with a monthly pass for the city buses ("kombinacija parkirišča in mesečne vozovnice za mestni promet",
Marprom order form).
File: examples/standards/efip/Slovenia_Maribor_ParkAndRide.xml (branch v2.1-wip-efip).

MODELLING
=========
- Kombinirana vozovnica P+R (parking + city bus) -> ONE PreassignedFareProduct with two ValidableElements:
    parking (validity limited to the three P+R car parks, ParkingRef, grouped OR) and city bus (TransportModes
    bus, BusSubmode localBus, OperatorRef Marprom). Same pattern as the bus + rail combination in the IJPP example.
- Mesečni najem (monthly rental) -> UsageValidityPeriod monthlyPass, StandardDuration P1M, unlimited use.
    The rent is paid by the last working day of the month for the next month (Marprom order form), which
    implies calendar months; use starts on the working day after the contract is signed.
- Parkirišče (parking part) -> not a SupplementProduct: Marprom sells only the package, not parking as an add-on
    to a bus pass (the parking-only monthly rent, EUR 31.40, and the hourly rate, EUR 0.60, are separate parking
    tariffs, not modelled here).
- Registrska oznaka vozila (licence plate) -> the parking right is bound to the car's registration number: a
    TypeOfTravelDocument with MediaType licencePlate in the SalesOfferPackage, next to the bus pass. "The
    registration number can be changed up to three times per month, effective from the next working day"
    (Marprom order form) has no typed NeTEx usage parameter; it is kept in the product Description.
    Exchanging/NumberOfExchangesAllowed counts exchanges of the product itself, not changes of the bound vehicle,
    so it is not used; a typed parameter for this would need a change request.
- Ni zagotovljenega mesta (no guaranteed space) -> ParkingReservation noReservations on the three car parks: the
    rental does not reserve a space ("najemodajalec ne jamči prostega parkirnega mesta", Marprom order form).
- Najemna pogodba (rental contract) -> one SalesOfferPackage with both travel documents (licence plate and bus
    pass), sold at the Marprom parking office.
- Cene (prices) -> one FareTable: EUR 49.00 per month, the same at all three car parks.

DATA SOURCE
===========
- Package, price, car parks and capacities, ordering: Marprom, "Vozni redi P+R",
  https://www.marprom.si/vozni-redi/vozni-redi-pr/ (read 2026-11-04): "Cena kombiniranega najema parkirišča P+R
  je 49 EUR/mesec", including "neomejeno parkiranje" and the use of the city buses; Koroška cesta about 90 spaces
  (white zone), Pod Koroškim mostom 55, Magdalena 220. Order form by e-mail or at the parking office at the main
  bus station (Mlinska ulica 1), then a rental contract.
- Payment, start of use, licence plate changes, no guaranteed free space: Marprom order form "Obrazec za
  naročilo kombinirane vozovnice P+R ali parkirnega mesta" (copy of 9 July 2026).
- Operator: copied from the NAP.si operator export of 2026-09-25 (contact e-mail left empty, website added).
- The car parks are not in the NAP.si exports, so they are created for this example, without coordinates.

CONVENTIONS
===========
- ids follow the Slovenian NAP profile, "SI:SI0:<Class>:<uuid>:IJPP" (frames ":NAP"); objects created for this
  example use the uuid block "1177-00f2"; the operator keeps its NAP.si id.
- PublicationDelivery version "2.1:EFIP" = NeTEx 2.1 + EFIP profile (provisional identifier).
-->
